%N A398527 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} A212793(k)/(k*(k+1)).
%C A398527 This constant appears in the asymptotic formula for A398526.
%H A398527 Joshua Stucky, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jnt.2021.09.015">The fractional sum of small arithmetic functions</a>, Journal of Number Theory, Vol. 238 (2022), pp. 731-739; <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.14142">arXiv preprint</a>, arXiv:2106.14142 [math.NT], 2021.
