%F A398527 Equals Sum_{k>=1} 1/A002378(A004709(k)) (the sum of reciprocals of the cubefree-indexed oblong numbers).
%F A398527 Equals 1/2 + Sum_{k>=2} (-1)^k * (D(k) - 1), where D(s) = zeta(s)/zeta(3*s) is the Dirichlet g.f. of A212793.
